  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The given equation is $\\tan x+\\sec x=2 \\cos x \\Rightarrow \\sin x+1=2 \\cos ^2 x$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow \\sin x+1=2\\left(1-\\sin ^2 x\\right) \\Rightarrow 2 \\sin ^2 x+\\sin x-1=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow(2 \\sin x-1)(\\sin x+1)=0 \\Rightarrow \\sin x=\\frac{1}{2},-1 \\Rightarrow x=30^{\\circ}, 150^{\\circ}, 270^{\\circ}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
